  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Humanitarian Support in Palestine.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Humanitarian Support in the Occupied Palestinian Territories (OPTs)&#x201d; programme aims to improve the resilience of households to mitigate the consequences of the protracted protection crisis in the OPTs; save lives during emergency spikes, for example a flare up in violence; and prevent a further deterioration in the humanitarian situation until a more durable political solution is reached.</narrative>
  </description>
